Also: Shopkeepers carry skeleton keys, guards do not.  Shopkeepers can
be killed behind closed doors where the guards do not see.  Peacefull
guards can be herded into rooms and then the doors can be locked to
keep them in, if you have plenty of patience to deal with their random
walking.  A boulder or two really helps channelize them if you happen
have any.  Once the guards are behind locked doors, they are easy to
deal with one by one.

